          "id": "23476b19-a32d-4963-a252-6658bedcf5e5",
          "memory": "User and Devon planned on September 23, 2026 to grab pizza at Rosa's on Oak Street at 7pm on Friday, September 25, 2026 after work. Both said they had not been in ages and crave the crust, with User noting Oak is easier than 5th, and they agreed to meet there with User texting when close and Devon grabbing a table.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d3f9d836-ae65-426a-a10c-0768ff4d45bd",
          "memory": "On September 23, 2026 Devon reaffirmed he is passing on his work team's Saturday lunch at Domino's at 2pm on September 26, 2026 to help his mom with groceries instead, saying the team will not drop it after a long meeting that day.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9711f4cb-4d6d-4fbf-9647-ee6eb2165353",
          "memory": "User said on September 23, 2026 that the lemon pepper chicken cooked on September 22, 2026 turned out pretty good and User had leftovers for lunch that day.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bd2716f6-6c92-4aeb-9145-573f857fcd6f",
          "memory": "Devon had a sad desk salad for lunch on September 23, 2026 and User sympathized, saying they hate those.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "6a4d0a7c-be0c-4f94-842b-9ff8daeac457",
          "memory": "User left early on Thursday, September 17, 2026 as Devon suggested but still hit slow traffic by the bank, with both noting on September 23, 2026 that the construction there is never-ending.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "63a5a789-6521-4063-85a5-23a8186b3322",
          "memory": "Devon said on September 23, 2026 that he started setting up autopay on the night of September 22, 2026 but got distracted, and plans to finish it that night to avoid more late fees after User urged him to finish it.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9d43a39-08ea-4784-9601-0cea44b8d15d",
          "memory": "User's mom called on September 23, 2026, with User telling Devon she was just complaining about her dryer.",
